{"version":1,"content":"<p>東九龍總區科技及財富罪案組與深圳巿公安局，於本年8月至10月期間展開代號為「翔城」行動，打擊跨境信用卡詐騙集團。</p><p>中港兩地共拘捕33人，涉及60宗盜用信用卡詐騙案，涉及款項逾180萬元。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T08:41:59.686952+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:15:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T23:18:03.642546+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T08:38:15.576073+00:00","content_hash":"30dab42eafc9ae20048314ba9674cc02ce76ff64e05f24d1f482cf5fd07d7cb8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}